Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:03:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,《异形魔怪4》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:38.79,Default,,0,0,8,,(内华达州 1889年)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:43.02,Default,,0,0,8,,(摒弃镇)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:49.23,Default,,0,0,8,,(老张的店)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:05.39,Default,,0,0,8,,(最后一文矿坑)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.40,0:33:27.39,Default,,0,0,8,,(一个月后)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.84,1:11:48.19,Default,,0,0,8,,(车站)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.16,1:12:56.79,Default,,0,0,8,,(理查火药枪弹之家)
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.72,1:36:04.18,Default,,0,0,8,,(完美城)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这里都是软泥 好好的挖吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Awful soft dirt in here. Make sure you shore it up good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.72,0:01:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,里面要闷死人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's like working inside a cow down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,挖到宝了 这足以买下农场了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Una vaca plata that is going to pay off my ranch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还买农场呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your ranch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像找女人一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, it's like a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,叫你难以自拔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all you ever talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她就可以大捞特捞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Meanwhile, she's taking all your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但你把钱全花在酒上面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you, you spend all of your money on whiskey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你很快就会知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you're going to miss me soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,维多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Victor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 维多？- 啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Victor? - Ugh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,维多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Victor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,杰夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jefe. Jefe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,杰夫 维多走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jefe, Victor is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean, "gone"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才刚开始呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were working the face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他不可能超过我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know he couldn't have got past me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但他就是不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now he's just gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,杰夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jefe! Jefe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,胡安 你在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan! Where are ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人都要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So many people leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都要摒弃我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is everyone rejecting us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的 福元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Fu Yien, we're sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要走是因为矿坑关闭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are leaving because the mine is closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这里得改个名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe we need a different name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可能这名字不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it was not the best choice, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不一定吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,胡安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan Padilla,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你看着这帽子个把月了 到底要不要买？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you've been looking at that hat for a month. Buy it or don't buy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我买不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, I can't afford it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,先欠着 以后再付{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You take it on credit, pay us later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不准赊帐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No credit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,史丹要走了 他正在搬东西上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stan Kelton is leaving. Loading up his wagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,史丹也要走？那镇上不就没有铁匠了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stan, too? Now we're a town without a blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,最后这里会唱空城记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It'll end up as a ghost town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,除非矿坑再开放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if that mine doesn't re-open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要是大伙都走光了 谁还会要来买东西呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If everybody leaves, who will buy our things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼才会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们该回老家去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we'll go back to China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要回老家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only way you going back to China{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你得先学会游泳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is if you learn how to swim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,抽到什么签？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does I Ching say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"强大的征服者即将来到"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Expect arrival of great conqueror."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,矿坑不会永远关闭着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mine will not stay closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,里面的银矿价值连城呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That ore is turning out 100 ounces to the ton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:05:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,比价值连城更多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two hundred, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还更多吗？谁都不会让这种财富溜走的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two hundred? Well, nobody is walking away from riches like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nobody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你也看到我所见到的 你也照样要落跑的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, if you saw what I saw, you might walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没说过你见到什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You never really told us what you saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就没看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw nothing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但是看不到比看到是什么 还要更可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the "nothing," it was worse than anything I have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你也想打退堂鼓了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not thinking of pulling out, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不 才不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I cannot do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我就像你一贫如洗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would lose everything, like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 是有关矿坑的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen! It's about the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,矿坑的老板就要来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The owner of the mine is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他要从费城过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All the way from Philadelphia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他说"不能接受 矿坑的利润变少"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He say, "Low profit from mine unacceptable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"全力出动"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Proceeding with all dispatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"我们要亲自处理此事"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Will take matters into hand personally."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,署名 甘哈兰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sign, Hiram Gummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这名字可真响亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's a real $2 name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌他会快刀斩乱麻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll wager he gets this thing solved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要不然就要火烧屁股了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}faster than a bee with a horse on its tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你打赌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bet you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,回见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, see you later now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有马车来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The stage is coming! It's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,迪科帕 克莉斯丁 有马车 要过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tecopa, Ms. Christine, the stage! It's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们猜他长什么样子 - 可能很胖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What do you think he looks like? - He's probably fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有钱人一向都很胖的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rich people are always fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 里面有人吗？- 满满的都是行李{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Anybody in there? - It's full of luggage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是时候了 - 的确是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- It's about time. - Indeed it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 您说什么？- 让我上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Pardon me, ma'am. - Let me in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我等不及要离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can't wait to get out of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么没有人下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one got out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,甘先生吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Hiram Gummer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我是张彭连 叫我老张就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Pyong Chang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的店铺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is my market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你并不胖嘛 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You're not very fat. - Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定有钱的要死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must have enough money to burn a wet mule, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫克莉斯丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Gummer, I'm Christine Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我是旅馆的主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Proprietress of the local hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是美丽大方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you're lovelier than Fifth Avenue in Spring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎到摒弃镇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome to Rejection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这名字真是贴切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aptly named, it would seem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来找安德鲁贝克威的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here to see one Andrew Beckwith,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我写给他三封信都没有回音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to whom I've sent three communiques, all unanswered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我要马上和他讲话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to speak to him forthwith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事不好办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That might prove to be a little difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？他在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why? Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在那上面 最后一批要走的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On that. The last stage out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太妙了 最后一批吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's just dandy. The last?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,乘客太少了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too few passengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,矿坑几星期前关闭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see, the mine closed several weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才会来 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is why you're here, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,矿坑关闭了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Closed? The mine closed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这么重要的事我一点都不知情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel I've not been privy to critical, most needful information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道 里面出了什么事吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't know what happens at the mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一天就死了17个矿工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seventeen miners were killed in one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,其他工人都不敢去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The workers abandoned it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,出了什么事呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seventeen? What on earth happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,谁也不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要我猜谜吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Must you speak in riddles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只有胡安看见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only person who could answer that question is Juan Pedilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那就叫他马上来见我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I should like to speak with him straight away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, he's out riding his land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,应该很快就回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We expect him back shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定累了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, you must be tired from your traveling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你到旅馆去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Won't you let me show you to the hotel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,来 我需要有人帮忙搬东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, come. I'll need assistance with my kit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是银行 不过当然是关闭着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is our bank. Closed, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,铁匠在这里 也关门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our blacksmith, also closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是邮局 也关了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And our post office. Closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好不热闹的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course. Quite the bustling metropolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"强大的征服者"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Great conqueror."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我的旅馆 欢迎光临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this is my hotel, welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,走这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hmm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好一堆武器 你是收藏吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An impressive arsenal. Are you a collector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,矿工是来西部发财的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The miners came West to strike it rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,每当他们该结帐时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When it came time to settle their bills,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大多都只剩下身上的枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}many of them had only their firearms left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我采用每日付费制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I collect payments daily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可以 先记帐就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nonsense. Just keep a running tab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你的人真无礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your man is rather impudent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,迪科帕不是我的人 只是朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tecopa is not my man. He is my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是帐棚而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But this is a tent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你真敏锐 喜欢哪一个？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. You're quite observant. Which one would you like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就这个吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This one right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 午餐几时会好？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dandy. And what time will luncheon be served?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,煤矿关闭后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, since the mine has closed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,补给车就不来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the supply wagons have stopped,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所以餐点会比较有限{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so our menu's a bit limited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你烧一碗豆子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could fix you a pot of beans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不必了 你应该有面粉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nonsense. Surely you have flour,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,糖浆和红姜吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}molasses and ginger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想吃姜饼 对 那样子就很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should like a ginger bread cake. Yes, that should do nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要我把他勒死吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you want me to strangle him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们需要他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. We need him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,动人的音乐加上可口的一餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Delightful music and a passable meal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要是再有一杯美酒更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which I should like to end with an aperitif.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wouldn't we all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一块姜饼 你要吃吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fu Yien, would you like that last piece of gingerbread?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去我的蓝色袋子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then go to my small carpet bag, the blue one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,拿我的白兰地过来 好的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and fetch my bottle of peach brandy. Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,姜饼怎么没了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happened to the ginger bread?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是我吃掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ate it, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你说…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I thought you said I could have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,给你个建议 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A word of advice, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都会被人占便宜 要是你占得了便宜 尽管去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anyone can be taken advantage of, and if you can, do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这样教小孩子很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is terrible advice to give a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他得面对这世界的现实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone needs to teach the boy the ways of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他当然会很清楚这些的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I assure you, he knows them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 胡安来了 他刚到店里 - 胡安？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Juan's here. He's over at the store. - "Juan"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,胡安 他是矿工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan Pedilla. The miner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 矿并没有被挖光 还有很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, no, no. The mine is not played out. Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,里面还有很多的银矿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is plenty more silver in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,只是没人敢进去开采{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just no one wants to go in and get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,出了事以后还有七个人进去过 却没有一个回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seven more men go up since accident. None come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我的祖先曾经说过 山里面有兽精{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My ancestors talked of spirit beasts that live inside those mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:13:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"兽精"？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Spirit beasts"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽就住在地底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beasts from the underworld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,无视一切 只会杀戮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Blind to all, but killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都知道 自己在说些什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you all taken leave of your senses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,召集剩下的矿工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan, I want you to gather up the remaining miners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,把那鬼东西给我捉住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hunt down whatever is doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,然后杀个精光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And fill 'em full of more holes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,片甲不留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than a cabbage leaf in a hail storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是这样 - 甘先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Precisely. - Senor Gummer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,城北还有一些矿工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there are some miners still camped north of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以找他们来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, I can go and talk to them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是没有钱他们可不做事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but they are not going to go back there unless you pay them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可能要用双倍的工钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe even double wages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.40,0:14:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,付钱？想再找回工作吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pay them? To earn their own jobs back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你 他们都很害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senor, I'm just telling you, they are scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不过为了防止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To ensure that my resources are not being squandered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,被这群恶棍乱敲竹杠 我和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by this cabal of hooligans, I shall accompany you myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,明天一早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}First thing in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you're talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你带了哪种枪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What kind of gun did you bring, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一定很炫很新型吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bet you it's big and fancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有带枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't own a firearm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方是大西部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the Wild West, Mr. Gummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看过小说吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't read the dime novels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要是碰上坏人 你可得保卫自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see a bad guy, you gotta smoke 'em up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 马准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senor Gummer, your horse is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}SenorGummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,早安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,骑车很辛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh,senor it is a hard day's ride{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.40,0:15:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其在这片荒野中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}over very rough country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是越野型的 让马背着工具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, this is the cross-country model. The horse can carry my kit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.12,0:15:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Off we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.76,0:16:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真是糟糕的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deplorable road conditions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.68,0:16:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我想我需要…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, I'd like some, uh... Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可能只要… 谢谢 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe just... Thank you. Ah, very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我再没有骑过马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I haven't been on a horse since I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,自从六岁生日后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since my sixth birthday party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 那时骑的是匹骆驼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, actually, that was a camel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 唔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 甘先生 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Gummer! - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is for you. Oh, I beg your pardon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,到了大西部 带着武器比较好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the Wild West. Never go unarmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不必了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, no, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, son, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你看他真的会是那个 强大的征服者吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You really think he is a great conqueror?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他骑骆驼比骑马 还要厉害的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only if he can ride a camel better than he can ride a horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,先别妄下判断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's not judge yet, Tecopa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们唯一的希望了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's the only chance we have. Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 大家好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Howdy, gents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就这些人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is our army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只有他们肯去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These are the only ones willing to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,总比没有好 不必花钱给胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All the better. No need to waste my money on cowards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 就是这位主顾 甘哈兰先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Men, this is the patrén, Mr. Hiram Gummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是华特兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These are the Walter brothers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 叫做砖头和石头 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Brick and Stony. - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是强生大马 - 强生先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- This is Big Horse Johnson. - Mr. Johnson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他是索基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this is Soggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,索基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们进去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, in you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,然后给我回报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And report back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都没有足够的领导力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As none of you possess sufficient leadership skills,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我得自己来带头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall supervise the endeavor myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,胡安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vémonos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 是杰夫 他是工头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Wait. - Ah, that was Jefe. Our foreman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我的帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他不需要了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He ain't gonna need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,戴戴看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Try it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Jefe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,矿坑就到这里了 维多曾到过这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the end of the mine, where Victor was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:20:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击过你们的东西 好像已经不在了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever attacked you, it would seem to be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我宣布矿坑现在已经安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen, I declare this mine perfectly safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说得没有错 - 里面连个鬼影都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dang right. - Ain't nothingin there but ghosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不必付钱给他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't need to pay them no wages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我们是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray that we are correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳要下山了 就在这里扎营好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, sun's gettinglow. Might as well set up camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不能扎营的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can't camp here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要找有树木的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样睡比较好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's better for the posture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 你又在欺负 那东西了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, damn. You gonna start torturing that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我会比较好睡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Helps me sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,而且马也喜欢听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the horses like it, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.32,0:21:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去弹给他们听吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, go play it for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你不懂音乐不能怪我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ain't my fault you lack a musical ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.60,0:21:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要多快重开矿坑？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How soon do you think you can re-open the mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:21:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,十万火急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Post haste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,越快越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sooner the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我得持续工作 才能保住我的农场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because I need to keep working if I don't want to lose my ranch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.44,0:22:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你也是个矿工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you were a miner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.96,0:22:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我是矿工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I am a miner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.12,0:22:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我父亲 一直梦想要买下一个农场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but my father always dreamed of having a ranch for us one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,后来呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有一次矿坑塌陷他死掉了 那时我还小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was killed in a cave-in when I was a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.96,0:22:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我的母亲 带着我们 一个个矿坑去工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, my mother, she moved us from mining camp to mining camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那里需要女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They always need a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,来洗衣烧饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to do the laundry and the cooking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的厨子离开好几星期了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been without my cook for weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.32,0:22:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是什么都有 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You always had everything, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,丰衣足食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Several of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd just like to get one of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.44,0:22:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What on earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 马跑了怎么回去呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, damn, we'll be hours finding them horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你这混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soggy, you sorry sack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.00,0:23:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把你打扁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna pound you blue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,大家不要急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Easy, easy, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,打他 砖头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You pound him, Brick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他最会放臭屁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's always fartingaround.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.56,0:23:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你上哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,躲起来对你没好处的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It won't do you no good hidin'!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,听声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Céllate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.08,0:23:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,听到没有？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我越找你会越生气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soggy, the longer I'm lookin', the madder I get!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老天 什么鬼东西？- 该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Good Lord, what? - Tarnation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.24,0:23:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,砖头 你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Brick! You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:24:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,石头 不要乱打瞎打的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stony! Don't you go shooting blind out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.08,0:24:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,砖头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Brick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.32,0:24:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.40,0:24:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 他不在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't know! He ain't out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那会是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.36,0:24:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在那里？我们手上有枪喔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who's over there? We've got guns over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.48,0:24:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What... What... What in God's name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.04,0:25:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪开快一点 全部杀光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You gotta shoot faster! Kill it, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.04,0:25:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得找个高的地方 - 哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We've got to get up somewhere! - Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,到那大石头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Over on that rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.72,0:25:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快到石头上面来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senor Gummer! Over here on the rock! On the rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.32,0:25:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大马 在这里 不要站在地面上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Big Horse! Over here! You gotta get off the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.44,0:25:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大马 来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Big Horse! Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.68,0:25:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 开枪没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Big Horse, you can't shoot it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.72,0:25:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,到这边 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This way, man! Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.24,0:25:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,到石头上面来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get on the rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.96,0:26:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,老天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good heaven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真是臭死人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a dreadful odor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.20,0:26:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在矿坑里面 也有闻到这种味道 就是它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I smelled it in the mine, it was them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.76,0:26:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是从软泥冲上来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They came up through the soft dirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它们无法穿过石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least it can't penetrate rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.68,0:26:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,它没有眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has no eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.56,0:27:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那它们 怎么知道我们的位置？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did they find us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.92,0:27:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,靠声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.04,0:27:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们发出声音 就会被发现 烧水声音也是一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every time we made a sound, even your teapot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.44,0:27:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是它们狩猎的方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's how they hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.08,0:27:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能老待在这里吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can't just stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.16,0:27:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那些小路上面铺着石块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These foothills are made of rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.36,0:27:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一路走回镇上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can walk on them almost all the way back to Rejection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.24,0:27:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,走路？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Walk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.72,0:27:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,难不成你想飞回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, unless you can fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.16,0:28:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tecopa. What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.04,0:28:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 挖个洞插旗子 - 插旗子？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Digginga spot for a flagpole. - A flagpole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.08,0:28:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这种时候你管他 内华达州有没有插旗子吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does it concern you that Nevada hasn't yet adopted a flag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.60,0:28:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这很重要 我马上就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will one day, and I'll be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们回来了 是胡安和甘先生 他们回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're back! They're back! It's Juan and Mr. Gummer! They're back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.36,0:28:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我就跑得越远越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd have walked twice that far to get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.88,0:29:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这种怪物真是太恐怖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those are the most savagerous beasts I've ever seen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你没有开枪扫射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, didn't you let loose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.52,0:29:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大开杀戒吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let fly? Barrels blazing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.36,0:29:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,老费迪 你不懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Old Fred, you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.20,0:29:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,它们不在地底下的话 它们就用飞的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When they're not underground, they're flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.36,0:29:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,飞得很快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.76,0:29:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,龙 是土龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tu-Long. Dragons. Dirt dragons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.36,0:29:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在中国没见过这种东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We never had them in China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.96,0:29:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,大马和胡安对怪物开枪 但是杀不死它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Big Horse, Juan, they tried to shoot them, but couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.88,0:29:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你是个快速神枪手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd have to be an unparalleled shootist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.24,0:29:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可是等一下 就是这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But wait, that's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.84,0:29:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得发出电报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A telegram, we must send a telegram immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.88,0:29:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来 我会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me do it. I know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.04,0:29:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这样 "征求枪手"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here. "Wanted. Gun fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.24,0:29:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"内华达州摒弃镇"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Town of Rejection, Nevada,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.08,0:29:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"需要经验丰富的快枪手"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"seeks experienced, quick-draw artist,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.52,0:29:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"必须处变不惊"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"calm in face of dangenr."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.12,0:29:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"价码面议"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Salary, negotiable."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.72,0:29:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,发到各大地区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, send that to the Territorial Enterprise,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.64,0:29:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,邮局 还有威其塔电讯去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Denver Post and the Wichita Eagle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.84,0:29:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你要雇用枪手吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're going to hire a gunfighter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.12,0:29:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为这是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bien, bien, bien. I think that is a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.36,0:30:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这样子好吗？这些枪手老是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But is it wise? A gunfighter's usually mean, wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.56,0:30:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,酗酒成性 胡作非为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drink, shoot inside house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.92,0:30:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要这种视死如归的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we need someone with fortitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.44,0:30:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要能够出生入死的勇猛铁汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone with a little sand in their craw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,正是 要具有精湛的枪法…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Exactly. Someone who is proficient with firearms, who can...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.20,0:30:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,百步之内仍旧 百发百中的神枪手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shoot the nuts off a squirrel at 100 paces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.28,0:30:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 就像霍立德那样的神枪手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Thank you. - Someone like Doc Holiday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.40,0:30:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是早死了的枪手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Except one that ain't dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.16,0:30:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,霍立德死了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doc Holiday's dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.96,0:30:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,弄好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay! It's done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.40,0:30:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就等消息吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, we wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.32,0:30:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,很不错吧 对不？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Handsome, no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.16,0:30:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,的确是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, very.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.56,0:30:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.80,0:30:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,能够有自己雕像的人可不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very few men have statues of themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.64,0:30:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是印地安人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A cigar store Indian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.32,0:30:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有个推销员给了我这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, a salesman gave that to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.04,0:30:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他当时付不了帐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he couldn't pay his bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.68,0:31:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那可能是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, it could be me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.68,0:31:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你的轮胎修好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Gummer, I fixed your wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.52,0:31:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 轮胎破得不像样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Impossible, it's a complete loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.44,0:31:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.44,0:31:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我的… 真是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, my, my, that's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.48,0:31:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 真是感谢你呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remarkable. Thank you. Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.44,0:31:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,请付五块钱就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That will be $5, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.20,0:32:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,少来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Five? Now listen here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.84,0:32:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,修个轮胎 不要两块钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No workman would dare ask more than two bits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我是镇上唯一会修轮胎的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm the only wheel-fixer in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.12,0:32:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你得上卡森城去找人修{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one else 'til Carson City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.00,0:32:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直是趁火打劫嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that's highway robbery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.24,0:32:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,给你个建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A word of advice, Mr. Gummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.28,0:32:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都会被人占便宜 要是你占得了便宜 尽管去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anyone can be taken advantage of. And if you can, do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,福元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fu Yien,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.72,0:32:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我身上的钱不够 我用东西跟你换吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a trifle short of cash at present. May we barter instead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.08,0:32:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我把这部单车给你 当作我付的钱吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For services rendered, you may have the bicycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.92,0:32:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经越来越会骑马了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's yours. I'm becoming quite the expert horseman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.08,0:32:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dandy, Mr. Gummer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.40,0:32:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,上去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.76,0:32:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 这样 我把你稳住 保持平衡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Ok, here, here, here. I'll steady you. Now, get your balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.00,0:32:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我一推你就踩踏板 前轮要保持直行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, when I push, press the pedals and keep the front wheel straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.76,0:33:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好了吗？开始走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready? Off you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.56,0:33:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还不赖嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not bad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.48,0:33:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not bad at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.20,0:33:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底还要吵多久？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long is this bedlam to last?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.24,0:33:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还要几天 我们要把井挖深一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, a few more days. We're deepening our well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.16,0:33:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对这引擎很自豪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, we're quite proud of our engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.24,0:33:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就可以用来发电点灯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's going to run our electric lights for us one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那你要能够忍受那鬼声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you can abide the racket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.68,0:33:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你一起帮忙我们会更快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, the work would go faster if you'd help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.32,0:33:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我这样的人 是不做劳力工作的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man of my means doesn't engage in physical labor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.60,0:34:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which brings us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.92,0:34:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,才可以向你收钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to your bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.04,0:34:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是有记帐吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're running a tab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.24,0:34:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那我没有同意过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In point of fact, I didn't agree to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.28,0:34:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好小姐 我到了哪里 亮出名字人人都买我的帐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Lord, in any civilized place, my name alone is, quite sufficient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.00,0:34:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在这种荒野西部 我们都只用现金交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, out here in the rough and tumble West, we tend to use cash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.48,0:34:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你手上的金表带 应该值20块钱吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, that is a $20 gold piece on your watch fob, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.20,0:34:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那表当然也是金子做的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the watch itself is gold, of course?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.48,0:34:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还有袖扣呢？是钻石吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the cufflinks? Genuine diamonds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.64,0:34:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你要我像路边小贩一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you proposing that I barter with you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.80,0:34:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,用这些来和你交换吗？少来这套了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as I would some street vendor in Calcutta? Don't be absurd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.52,0:34:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你先给我记帐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will run a proper tab until this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.04,0:34:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,直到这鬼地方的银行开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}pathetic town has a proper bank{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.28,0:34:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的钱就可以汇到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to which I can wire funds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.16,0:35:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here now. What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.68,0:35:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不骑车上？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why aren't you riding that wheel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.60,0:35:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没时闲 我很忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No time. I'm working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.88,0:35:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些人最会拖延时闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You men, you'll take forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.08,0:35:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要小孩做大人的事吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Using a boy to do a man's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.92,0:35:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这下面很窄的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very narrow down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.20,0:35:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,只有他的身材 挤得进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's the only one small enough to widen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.36,0:36:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.24,0:36:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,等他把洞挖大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, the moment it is wide enough,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.60,0:36:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你就得找人下去换手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I expect to see one of you down there in his place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.92,0:36:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,让他可以去骑车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he back on that bicycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.12,0:36:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我应该要道歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, Mrs. Lord, I should like to apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.80,0:36:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The truth is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的金币 手表和袖扣 是我最后剩下的财产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my coin, watch and cufflinks are all I own in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.44,0:36:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.80,0:36:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲最后老得痴呆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father, in his final demented days,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.84,0:36:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,把他所有的财产资金 通通投资{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sold all his holdings and invested everything, the entire family fortune,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.72,0:36:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,到某一个银矿中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in a certain silver mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.16,0:36:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.96,0:36:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,之前我很无礼 很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was rude earlier. I apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.08,0:36:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,只要银矿开工了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once I get the mine running,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.32,0:37:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我就可以还你钱 而且我会马上离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll pay my bill in full and be on the first stage out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.20,0:37:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就像老费迪讲的 屋漏偏逢连夜雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As old Fred would say, that's a real gully washer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.60,0:37:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别看我 这和我没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't look at me. I had nothing to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.24,0:37:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,希望老费迪在这之前 就到达驿站了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope Old Fred made it to the muling station before this hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.20,0:37:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天那么热 今天却下雨了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yesterday a desert. Today a monsoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.80,0:37:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只要矿坑重开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once I re-open the mine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.88,0:37:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,整个镇就会繁荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the whole town will prosper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.04,0:37:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会要什么有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll be able to afford whatever your hearts desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.96,0:37:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那你想要什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what is it that your heart desires, Mr. Gummer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.56,0:37:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,回到过去的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To return to the life I had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,每天早上醒来就想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To wake up every morning and wonder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.64,0:37:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"今天我要怎么花钱呢？"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"What will I spend my money on today?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.12,0:38:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A curious philosophy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.88,0:38:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌你怎么花钱不重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would venture that it matters not how you spend your money,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.60,0:38:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,重要的是你怎么运用生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but how you spend your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.28,0:38:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,甘先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Gummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.76,0:38:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大人讲话不要插嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't interrupt your elders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.92,0:38:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 好小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never you mind, Mrs. Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.32,0:38:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等到死神来敲我的门 我会改邪归正的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll amend my misspent life when the Grim Reaper comes calling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.88,0:38:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你把枪收好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I recommend that you keep that hog leg skinned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.60,0:38:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你想自找麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unless you got a desire to bejumpingover hot coals in hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.60,0:38:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,请问你是谁？先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who might you be, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.36,0:38:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,凯力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kelly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.68,0:38:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,黑手凯力吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Black Hand Kelly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.28,0:39:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我要找甘哈兰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm looking for Hiram Gummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.64,0:39:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would be me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.84,0:39:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是登了个启事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You posted yourself an advertisement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.80,0:39:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did. Yes, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.04,0:39:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我杀谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, who do you want me to kill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.96,0:39:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那边那个瘪三吗？- 不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- That Injun over there - No, no, no no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.36,0:39:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要杀的不是人 是怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not so much a "who" as a "what."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.48,0:39:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,它们会从地底窜出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They spring from the ground like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.40,0:39:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就像怪物一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like some demonic trout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.88,0:39:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们叫它土龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We call them Tu-Long. Uh, Dirt Dragons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.80,0:39:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西味道一定很烈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This stuff sure must be a whole lot stronger than it tastes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.40,0:39:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定会觉得那是天方夜谭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're well aware that it sounds fantastic,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.36,0:39:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们说的都是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we can assure you it's all quite true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.76,0:39:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,它们很凶残 动作很快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're ferocious and fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.72,0:39:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要真的勇士才能打倒它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It takes some real backbone to face them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.24,0:39:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我只会为了取乐 去打响尾蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amigo, I like to fight with rattle snakes just for the fun of it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我会先引他咬我的靴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I give them the first bite to boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.64,0:40:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,先别自吹自擂 你很会用枪吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hyperbole aside, you are accurate with a firearm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.76,0:40:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,怀疑我的能力吗？先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You questioning my abilities, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.20,0:40:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是生意人 所以我… - 嘿 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- As an astute business man, I'm simply... - Hey, boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,给我丢个苹果过来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Toss me one of them apples over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.68,0:40:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 我就说 要闹事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See, I knew it. Shoot inside house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.40,0:40:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要丢很高吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Throw it high?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.48,0:40:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 直接对着我丢过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,no,no. You throw it right straight at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.56,0:40:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.44,0:40:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.12,0:40:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.60,0:40:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是要射苹果的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We thought you'd shoot apple. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.56,0:40:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为你是要示范…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Obviously, we are expecting to see a demonstration of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.20,0:41:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你获雇用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're hired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.44,0:41:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在中国 没人会对着墙开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In China, no one shoots in wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.08,0:41:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在中国 没人手上有枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In China, no one has gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.68,0:41:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在我签约之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before I sign up for anything,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.76,0:41:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来谈谈"价码面议"这部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}talk to me about that, "salary negotiable" part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.20,0:41:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢银块吗？凯力先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you like silver, Mr. Kelly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.12,0:41:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,当然喜欢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I reckon I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.92,0:41:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等到怪物通通解决了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, then, upon dispatching all the aforementioned creatures,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.28,0:41:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,而且矿坑可以开工了 我会用银块付给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and upon the subsequent re-opening of the mine, you'll be paid in silver,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.04,0:41:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,多得让你用马匹也载不动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}say as much as you can carry on a strong horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.20,0:41:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, now, I just bet that you could{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.00,0:41:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,重赏之下必有勇夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}charm a cow right out of her calf{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.88,0:41:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一定叫人难以拒绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with those fancy words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.44,0:41:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但是为了我自己 我得先收点订金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now, for myself, I sort of need a little something up front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.08,0:41:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们身上可没有钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we don't have any money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.40,0:41:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.48,0:42:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们花时闲陪我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.68,0:42:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我有钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Double Eagle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.44,0:42:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是订金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A down payment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.84,0:42:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell you what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.64,0:42:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你给我袖扣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You throw in them there cufflinks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.80,0:42:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事就搞定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you got yourself a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.84,0:42:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你收集的枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is one sorry collection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.84,0:42:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真是可悲啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of lead pushers you got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.20,0:43:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我的店是不卖枪的 凯力先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not running a gun store, Mr. Kelly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.64,0:43:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这把长枪给你用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan, you take this here, big old .45-70.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.64,0:43:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己挑一把枪吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hiram, pick yourself out something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.20,0:43:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,要合适的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that feels right in your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.44,0:43:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,把你所有的子弹都给我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, you give us all these blue whistlers that you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.48,0:43:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇噢 - 胡安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Whoa. - Juan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.44,0:43:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.64,0:43:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是付不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, but, Lu Wan, I still can't afford it, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.40,0:43:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不必付钱 送给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No credit, it's a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.92,0:43:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gracias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.04,0:43:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么？在中国人人头上都戴着帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What? No one goes without a hat in China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.56,0:43:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们浩浩荡荡出发吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, boys, let's jingle some spurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.28,0:43:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要张扬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. No. No spurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.60,0:43:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不要发出任何的声响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In fact, no jingling of any kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.88,0:44:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那些怪物只要听到 一点声音就会过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tell you, these things are attracted by the slightest noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.60,0:44:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而且随时会从地底窜出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They could leap from the ground at any moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.68,0:44:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,胡安在这里杀了一只{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan killed one right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.04,0:45:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There ain't nothing here neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.48,0:45:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可能它们都聋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe they gone deaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.48,0:45:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你们 这两个家伙在耍我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or maybe you two boys are playing me for the fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.40,0:45:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我付你钱是假的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After what I paid you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.84,0:45:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须不断的搜查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will just have to keep looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.76,0:45:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你 帮我一把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan, if you please, some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.00,0:45:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,少来了 你丢不丢脸？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gummer, dag nab it, ain't you got no pride?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.88,0:45:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,自己想法子上马去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get up on the horse by yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.52,0:45:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我若需要重新学学骑术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should I ever again require horsemanship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.64,0:45:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找个老师教我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will engage a tutor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.36,0:46:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I'll tell you one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.32,0:46:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我没读过什么书 但是我很清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ain't got your book-learning but I know this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.88,0:46:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,长大成人 不代表你就是个男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}being full-growed don't make you a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.80,0:46:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, look, look, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.72,0:46:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here, here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.76,0:46:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是蛋壳 是蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They appear to be shells. Eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.96,0:46:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,若这是它们的蛋…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, if that's what they are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.40,0:46:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那一定是只很大的母鸡生下的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then they came out of one big chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.92,0:46:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你们俩 真的不是胡言乱语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or maybe you two aren't as crazy as I've been thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.68,0:46:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们从矿坑 引出来的温泉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is where we pipe the hot spring from the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.64,0:47:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,水从土中穿过 看到没？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The water cut through the dirt, you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.84,0:47:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,所以蛋露出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the eggs fell out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.28,0:47:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是温泉让它们孵化的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps the warm water hatched them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.24,0:47:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就知道有几只了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan, this tells us how many there are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.20,0:47:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有四只 一只已经被我干掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are four. And I killed one already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.16,0:47:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下三只{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.52,0:47:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它们会在哪里呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But where could they have gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.24,0:47:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们继续骑马去找吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we're just going to keep on riding until we find them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.12,0:47:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要马上就好好地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because I'm getting awful anxious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.96,0:47:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大干一票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to unravel me some cartridges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.40,0:47:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这温泉是六个月前引出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, we piped that hot water out only six months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.68,0:47:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这些怪物长大得真快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then, those creatures grew large quite quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.80,0:47:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是其中一只的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's a part of one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.88,0:47:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,它们背上有这种鳞片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These scaly things were on their backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.24,0:47:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.48,0:48:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可能其中有一只死掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, maybe one of them there "things" died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.12,0:48:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,或者那只是脱皮 就像蛇一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or maybe... Maybe he shed his skin, like a snake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.12,0:48:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在那里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.36,0:48:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是老费迪 那是他的马车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Old Fred. At least, that's his wagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.76,0:48:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,老天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.36,0:48:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我有不好的预感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This does not bode well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.36,0:48:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩下支离破碎的残骸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now that is one catawampusly chawed-up rig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.88,0:48:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说过…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I keep saying... saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.68,0:48:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这种东西可不是好对付的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These things are not to be trifled with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.88,0:48:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,老费迪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Old Fred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.00,0:49:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,老费迪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Old Fred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.84,0:49:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,老费迪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Old Fred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.56,0:49:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得应该要弄长一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe we should have made it longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.28,0:49:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要再搬石头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I'm not toting no more rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.12,0:49:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该说些告别词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.32,0:49:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本就不认识他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't even know the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.64,0:50:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,拿下你的帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take off your hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.48,0:50:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,费迪是个老人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fred was an old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.92,0:50:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们才叫他老费迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is why we call him Old Fred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.64,0:50:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他负责运货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He drove the freight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.60,0:50:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他有口臭 只是我不讲而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had bad breath. But I don't want to say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.48,0:50:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.32,0:50:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"无惧炎炎的热日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Fear no more the heat of the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.32,0:50:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也无畏刺骨的冬寒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor the furious winter's rages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.68,0:50:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你的使命完成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thou thy worldly task hast done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.64,0:50:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,回归家园 丰硕一生"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Home art gone, and ta'en thy wages."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.96,0:50:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是辛白林第四幕的第二场戏 我们该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cymbeline. Act IV, Scene 2. We'd best get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.48,0:50:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我们在这里扎营吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, wait, Let's make camp here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.48,0:50:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们要到山岭上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no. We'll go to the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.16,0:50:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要在石地上扎营{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Camp on solid rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.84,0:50:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就如每个晚上一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As we have every night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.52,0:50:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那还要走三英里路 路很不好走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, that is three miles back there. That's hard country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.32,0:51:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,难道要我冒险 睡在这毫无防护的地面上…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you think I'm going to risk sleeping on the naked earth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.08,0:51:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以到驿站去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or we could go down to the muling station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.60,0:51:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就在峡谷那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Down the canyon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.24,0:51:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,安全吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.32,0:51:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, there are very thick beams{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.36,0:51:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那里地上铺着排列马车的板子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the floor, you know, for the wagons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.68,0:51:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,土龙没办法窜出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no way these dragons could break through them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.72,0:51:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那里会有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Might there be someone here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.72,0:51:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 补给的马车不来了…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, they stopped running the supply wagons, now that the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.04,0:51:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,矿坑关闭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now that the mine is closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.56,0:51:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的生命只剩下苦头可吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, the bitter refrain of my life, it seems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.88,0:51:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把马绑好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must secure these horses with certainty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.88,0:51:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,上次马匹跑掉了 真糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The last time, they got away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.56,0:51:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你要确保 大门是牢牢的关上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You just make sure that gate is tied up tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.68,0:52:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,凯力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Kelly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.20,0:52:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你面对这一边 根本就看不到大门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't see the door if you're facing this direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.76,0:52:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,随时保持警戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Always be prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.56,0:53:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What in God's name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.68,0:54:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这些鬼东西吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, was that them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.68,0:54:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.08,0:54:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是另一种东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.12,0:54:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是你要我挑一把顺手的枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said to pick something I was comfortable with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.56,0:54:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 是我说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're right. I did say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.60,0:54:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么有这种怪味道？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What in Sam Hill is that smell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.96,0:54:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它们来了 就是这味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's them. That's the smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.72,0:54:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,记得吧 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remember, sefior?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.92,0:54:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它们变了 变得更长更细{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But they've changed so, become long and thin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.08,0:54:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一共有六只 可能有九只{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's six of them or even nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.52,0:54:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,最好把马匹带进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'd better bring the horses inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.56,0:55:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,马儿又不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Chingada! They're gone. Again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.64,0:55:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能靠自己跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can't go on foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.00,0:55:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会被捉住的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'll get us for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.24,0:55:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.12,0:55:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就在这里不动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, that means we have to stand our ground here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.60,0:55:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你得真的学会用枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hiram, it's about time you learned how to use a real piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.44,0:55:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的工作 我要找人用枪 所以我雇用你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's your job. If I need a gun fired, I hire a gunman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.12,0:55:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你若想带着美女上床{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you want to bed down with a real pretty woman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.20,0:55:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你也会雇人来做吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suppose you just hire somebody to do that, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.28,0:55:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不必在这里耍嘴皮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spare me your tiresome analogies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.08,0:55:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我说过一遍了 现在我再说一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hiram! Now I said this once, and I'm gonna say it one more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.48,0:55:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事情是要亲力而为的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's some things that a man has to do for himself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.64,0:55:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这件事就是要靠自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and right now shooting is one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.12,0:55:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,把那笨东西给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And give me that stupid hideout piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.80,0:55:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这对你根本没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It ain't gonna do you no good now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.44,0:55:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 胡安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, Juan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.00,0:56:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你好好注意 那些蛇样的鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You keep your eye peeled for them there snake things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.60,0:56:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,注意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pay attention, Hiram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.92,0:56:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我要用左轮手枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, this is a single-action Colt Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.16,0:56:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最好的左轮手枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the finest wheel gun ever made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.96,0:56:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不要笨手笨脚的握枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't be holding it like it's some skunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.32,0:56:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你手掌的延伸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, it's an extension of your hand, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.68,0:56:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是你身体的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hmm. It's part of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.36,0:56:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就位瞄准 好好发狠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And take yourself a stance, like you mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.12,0:56:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么发狠？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mean what? Like you mean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.12,0:56:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你手上的枪管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that every last lead plum,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.16,0:56:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所发出的每一发子弹 都是快狠准的击中目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that comes out of that barrel is gonna kill whatever you aim at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.84,0:56:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对 打一枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, okay, take yourself a shot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.16,0:56:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对着窗子上的罐子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at that can over there by the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.72,0:56:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你伸直手臂对准目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You line up this blade with this notch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.16,0:56:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,然后扣下板机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you just squeeze the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.00,0:56:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不要猛按{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't jerk it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.80,0:56:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.04,0:56:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.52,0:56:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,它们没法子窜过地上的板子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They cannot break through the floor beams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.16,0:57:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好 放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.84,0:57:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,把眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You just let your eyes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.12,0:57:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,脑子 手掌和手指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your brain, your hand, your trigger finger, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.16,0:57:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,都合而为一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All becomes one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 现在你控制得很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all right. You got consistency now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.64,0:57:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是浪费时闲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a waste of time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.52,0:57:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那你还想怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you expect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.72,0:57:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你以为花20分钟 就可以学会我20年的工夫吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wanna learn in 20 minutes what took me 20 years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.24,0:58:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,它们没法子穿过地板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They cannot break through the floor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.24,0:58:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就想要把地板拆开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so they are tearing it apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.64,0:58:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里来这种大蛇呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How could a snake be so strong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.28,0:58:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,看那里 它们在设陷阱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look at that! They decoyed us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.44,0:58:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 它们怎么这么聪明？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Lord! How smart are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.48,0:58:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快要没有立足之地了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Esta malo, we're gonna have nothing left to stand on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.56,0:58:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,电报呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A telegraph?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.44,0:58:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没啥好用处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, but it's no good for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.36,0:58:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本不知道怎么打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't know the clicking code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.56,0:58:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,随便打点东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, click anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.00,0:58:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就有人会知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely someone will hear us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.48,0:58:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不知是什么 那不是摩斯码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know what it means. It's not in Morse code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.32,0:58:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,已经持续了一个小时了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This has been going on for more than an hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.32,0:58:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是树枝碰到电线 以前也曾经这样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe a tree is touching the wire. That happened before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.48,0:58:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这个不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. This is different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.96,0:59:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,卡森城的电报员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But surely, the telegrapher from Carson City{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.16,0:59:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不会让这种事发生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wouldn't allow such foolishness with his equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.44,0:59:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可能不是来自卡森城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe not Carson City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.16,0:59:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那里 还会有哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not Carson City? Where else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.64,0:59:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是来自卡森城的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is from Carson City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.16,0:59:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那个是哪儿来的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's that one from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.64,0:59:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,来自驿站的 一定是甘先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is from the muling station. It must be Mr. Gummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.52,0:59:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只有他会在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's the only one out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.04,0:59:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,迪科帕和阿彭几时会回来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When did Tecopa and Pyong say that they'd be back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.20,0:59:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一两天吧 他们出城去了 去买柴火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One, two days. Gone up-country. Getting firewood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.28,0:59:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我自己去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right then. I'll go myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.60,0:59:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.76,0:59:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要打得这么用力吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Must you tap so loudly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.64,1:00:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你只管用枪就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let your lead fly, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.52,1:00:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,到底要对付的 是什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell are we up against?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.20,1:00:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,它们长大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They grew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.56,1:00:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那些根本不是蛇 那是舌头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those snakes are not snakes. They are tongues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.28,1:01:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,三个舌头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three tongues!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.76,1:01:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,每只怪物有三个舌头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Each creature has three tongues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.52,1:01:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看到了九个舌头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we saw nine before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.16,1:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以一共只有三只怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, there's still only three animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.08,1:01:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这值得我高兴吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that's supposed to make me feel better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.28,1:01:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,每只怪物都比 配八只驴子的货运马车还要大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good God, man, those things are the size of eight-mule freight wagons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.52,1:01:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快开枪 那是你的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, shoot them! That's what you're hired to do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.44,1:01:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要先清楚对手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got to know your enemy, Hiram!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.72,1:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该要带大炮来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ought to be totingsome eight-bore firing solid shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.96,1:01:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,至少也要有火炮枪 而不是手上这种小玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or some damn punt gun. Not these weapons I got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.96,1:01:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 告诉你我们该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. All right. I'll tell you what we're gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.60,1:01:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先不要开枪 等到它们追了过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're gonna hold our fire till they come after us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.04,1:01:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们一股作气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then we're gonna gotoe-to-toe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.76,1:01:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,全力攻击扫射一番 用所有的子弹打它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}point-blank, full-bore, throw all the lead we got at 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.28,1:01:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,然后看看是否有幸运中奖的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then, maybe we'll get a lucky hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.80,1:02:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定一枪命中什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A brain shot. Or something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.68,1:02:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,地板剩下没几片了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is not much floor left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.76,1:02:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,它们随时要展开攻击了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'll be makingtheir move any time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.36,1:02:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.68,1:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,或许就是这次了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This may be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.36,1:03:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在打什么主意？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now what are they up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.68,1:03:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,凯力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Kelly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.12,1:03:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,吃子弹吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eat this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.32,1:04:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我没子弹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm out! I'm out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.12,1:04:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,克莉斯丁来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Christine is coming, SenorGummer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.64,1:04:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Christine! Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.28,1:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,驾着马车快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just drive the wagon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.32,1:04:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,凯力先生在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Mr. Kelly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.52,1:04:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,死了 快走 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dead! Go!Go!Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.56,1:04:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well done, Mrs. Lord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.56,1:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,它们有跟上来吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are they following us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.20,1:04:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't tell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.12,1:04:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有 它们在后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes! They are following us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.32,1:04:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.36,1:04:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它们已经到了极限 - 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- They're at their limit! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.24,1:04:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.20,1:05:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,它们好大 穷凶恶极{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're enormous. Ravenous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.80,1:05:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"来自暗处中的兽精"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spirit demons from dark places,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.20,1:05:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"吞噬了光明中的灵魂"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}eating souls that live in the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.84,1:05:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Part of our legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.40,1:05:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不断对它们开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We put bullet after bullet into them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.40,1:05:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,却一点也阻档不了它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it didn't even slow them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.40,1:05:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,它们会追过来吗？到镇上吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will they come here, to our town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.56,1:05:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那它们得通过障碍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have to get through the pass from the upper valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.96,1:05:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有许多石头 应该过不来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lots of rocks. Maybe they can not do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.56,1:05:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那不重要 矿坑还是无法接近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It hardly matters. The mine will remain unapproachable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.44,1:05:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那你有什么打算？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what is your intention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.28,1:05:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的打算是离开这邪恶之地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My intention? To leave this godforsaken place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.84,1:05:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也应该快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as should all of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.20,1:06:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可是那矿坑…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.80,1:06:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你听懂没？矿坑没有了 忘掉一切吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you listening? The mine is lost! Forget the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.40,1:06:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,重新开始你的生活吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go on with your lives as if it never existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.40,1:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一切重新开始 我也是一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Start your lives over, just as I will have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.52,1:06:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会让这种笨虫 逼得离开自己的土地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No stupid animal is going to make me leave my land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.00,1:06:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我要到卡森城去 我要买些火药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can go to Carson City, get some blasting powder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.60,1:06:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经走运了 真的走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan,one we were lucky. Dumb lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.76,1:06:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,像黑手凯力这种好手都完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If a man like Black Hand Kelly is no match for them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.68,1:06:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有什么机会呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what chance do we have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.60,1:06:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,留下来做什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pyong, why in heaven would you stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.80,1:06:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,带着福元和老婆回中国去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take Fu Yien and the missis back to China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.76,1:06:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我老婆不走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lu Wan forgets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.44,1:06:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,中国不完美 世上没有完美之处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}China not perfect. No place perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.60,1:06:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不要离开新的家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will not leave our new home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.72,1:07:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找人来拿我的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall send for my belongings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.56,1:07:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 马匹和设备我会送回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, of course, I shall see to it that the horse and equipment are returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.32,1:07:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那倒不必{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.96,1:07:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,马儿就给你吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can keep the horse and the saddle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.64,1:07:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这马鞍 来福枪 还有小刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the rifle and the knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.44,1:07:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,和你交换那矿坑所有权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In trade for ownership of the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.64,1:07:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't be serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.44,1:07:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你能得到最好的条件了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the best offer you're going to get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.84,1:07:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回到费城 最低要以五万美元出售矿坑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I reach Philadelphia, I intend to sell that mine for at least $50,000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.32,1:07:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前我会先用电报 发送新闻消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will be preceded by a telegram to the newspapers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.20,1:07:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉大家怪物的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}describing in great detail these creatures that plague the mine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.76,1:07:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还有不能采矿的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and why it is unworkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.32,1:07:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不会这样出卖我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's blackmail. You wouldn't betray me like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.00,1:07:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们投票通过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We voted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.68,1:07:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,四比一通过赞成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Four-to-one in favor of doing exactly that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.44,1:07:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,至少剩下一个人有道德感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least one of you has some sense of ethics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.40,1:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我投的是把你推下悬崖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I voted to drop you off a cliff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.84,1:07:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,留下来 一起战斗吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay with us, Hiram. Stay and fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.76,1:07:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在浪费生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're wasting your lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.48,1:08:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那邪恶矿坑给你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can have the cursed mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.00,1:08:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,喔噢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoa! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.24,1:08:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要离开我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Gummer. Please don't leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.08,1:08:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮不上忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fu Yien, I can't help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.16,1:10:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们错了 它们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were wrong. They're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.32,1:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那些土龙通过了山谷的障碍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The dirt dragons. They got through the upper valley pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.40,1:11:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还不知几时会到 就快过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know when, but they are definitely coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.56,1:11:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,或许它们不发现我们 直往南去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe they not find us. Keep going south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.92,1:11:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,它们会听声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,no,no,no, they hunt by sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.56,1:11:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里只有我们会出声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are the only thing making noise between here and Carson City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.40,1:11:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,签上说的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do the sticks say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.84,1:11:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"穷凶恶极即将降临"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Expect a ferocious arrival."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.72,1:11:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那就完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, this is it then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.92,1:11:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,摒弃镇完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The end of Rejection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.00,1:11:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一张下一班到费城的车票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One ticket for your next train to Philadelphia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.76,1:11:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要有卧铺的 单程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sleeping car, one way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.04,1:11:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.28,1:12:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fools!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.72,1:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你再说一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.16,1:12:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,摒弃镇那些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The people up in Rejection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.72,1:12:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是天大的玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Funnier than a dancing bear, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.80,1:12:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这是昨天送过来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here's one they sent yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.44,1:12:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"巨虫通过山谷 可能到达城镇"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Giant worms have left upper valley. May find town."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.12,1:12:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可以借我吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.36,1:12:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"即刻需要救助"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Need immediate help."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.60,1:12:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"有巨虫"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Giant worms."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.00,1:12:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一张票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One ticket...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.24,1:12:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你的票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir? Your ticket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.72,1:13:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我想做个拉车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was thinkingmaybe I could make some kind of sled for it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.16,1:13:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可以用马车来拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we could pull it behind the last wagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.60,1:13:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,来不及了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.44,1:13:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,还是放弃吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Time to let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.44,1:13:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪里呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan, where will you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.52,1:13:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,听说多诺帕有个新的矿坑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, there is a new strike, down near Tonopah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.96,1:13:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想到那里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm thinking of heading that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.08,1:13:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们要去哪里呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where will we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.72,1:13:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到三藩市去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are going to San Francisco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.16,1:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,然后回去中国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then back to China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.68,1:14:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的钱都投在店里 现在全都没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All our money is put in the store, and now it's all gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.76,1:14:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能像爸爸妈妈一样 在铁路上工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you are not going to work on the rail road like Momma and Poppa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.36,1:14:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.76,1:14:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,no,no. Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.20,1:14:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是从北边过来的 不是从南边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will come from the north, not from the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.24,1:14:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那是别的东西 或是另有其人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is something else. Or someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.76,1:14:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个可怜的家伙 挑这个时候来这里的呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What poor soul would be coming here now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.68,1:15:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是甘先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Mr. Gummer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.20,1:15:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.28,1:15:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"穷凶恶极即将降临"吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"A ferocious arrival"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.00,1:15:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hyah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.76,1:15:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我最后会让你留下他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, now, maybe I'll let you keep him after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.08,1:15:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 哎呀 真是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoa! Stop! Whoa! Curse you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.44,1:15:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不轻易妥协的野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoa! You intransigent beasts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.48,1:15:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你们安好无恙真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Delighted to see you're all well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.08,1:15:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,它们随时就会到达了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hiram, they're coming. They could be here at any minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.20,1:15:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 你到底在想什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I know. - Whatever are you thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.32,1:15:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这西部田园不该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That this idyllic Western retreat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.16,1:15:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,让那些没脑子的怪物霸占{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shall not fall prey to these mindless predators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.12,1:15:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了很多武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have here a cache of weapons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.76,1:15:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,连已故黑手凯力看了都会笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that would impress even the late Black Hand Kelly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.32,1:16:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是52口径的来福猎枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One Sharps .52 caliber buffalo rifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.00,1:16:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是45口径的长枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One Remington .45-120, Rolling block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.60,1:16:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是猎枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One Henry repeater rifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.08,1:16:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,口径虽小 火力可不小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Smaller caliber, but impressive rate of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.36,1:16:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,还有八发子弹…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One 8-gauge Remington, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.48,1:16:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,德林加枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Derringer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.00,1:16:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是新型的长枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One LC Smith 10-gauge stub-twist coach gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.68,1:16:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.48,1:16:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,火炮枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A two-inch bore punt gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.64,1:16:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会有这些东西？你不是没有钱了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hiram, how did you get all of these things? You don't have any money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.88,1:16:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有个智者曾告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A wise friend once told me it's not important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.84,1:16:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,重要的不是我怎么花钱 而是我怎么运用生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how you spend your money, but how you spend your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.96,1:16:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我们应该怎么办呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hiram Gummer, what is it you think we are going to do? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.56,1:17:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,夫人 我们要给这些访客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, I intend we throw our visitors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.16,1:17:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,来个出其不意的反击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a little corpse and cartridge occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.44,1:17:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要这样面对面 和那些可恶的怪物打斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That we stand our ground and fight these despicable beasts to the death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.24,1:17:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.96,1:17:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.48,1:17:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了两年才说服你 离开中国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It takes me two years to make you leave China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.08,1:17:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不想再回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think I want to go back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.24,1:17:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们愿意 - 把它们都踩扁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We do it. - We'll stomp 'em like snakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.44,1:17:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,烧个精光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will burn them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.60,1:17:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一只只捉来活烤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll smoke 'em up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.84,1:17:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah! Juan, knowing you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.52,1:17:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要新帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'll need a spare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.32,1:17:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gracias, amigo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.76,1:17:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,它们应该会从北边 或东北边过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'll probably be coming from the north or the northeast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.36,1:17:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们跳出去扫射它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we go out there and shoot them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.96,1:18:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那太危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too dangerous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.28,1:18:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,它们可能来自四面八方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They can come up anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.76,1:18:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可不能 赤手空拳引诱它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. We dare not face them on their terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.04,1:18:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,用马 它们一过来…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should take a horse out there and when they go for it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.12,1:18:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太残酷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tecopa, that's cruel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.96,1:18:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正处在残酷的时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, these are cruel times!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.12,1:18:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不能用别的东西 来发出声音吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can't we make noise with something else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.64,1:18:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is a good idea, Fu-ito.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.04,1:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有声音就可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any noise works,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.16,1:18:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不见得要用马匹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}itdoesn% have to be a horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.32,1:18:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以弄出这样的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We could make noise on something like this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.64,1:18:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,只要它们出现 我们就开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and then when they come up, we shoot them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.40,1:18:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对 来个愉袭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, an ambush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.76,1:18:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,把它们引到枪口来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will lead them into our very gun-muzzles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.56,1:18:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,摒弃镇就是我们的要塞 最后一道防线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will make Rejection our last bastion, our last line of defense!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.56,1:18:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的阿拉莫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our Alamo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.12,1:18:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,阿拉莫是战败的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan, we were the losers at the Alamo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.84,1:18:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己才失败 乡巴佬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak for yourself, gringo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.40,1:18:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还要罐头 需要更多铁罐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More cans. I need more cans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.68,1:18:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经尽快在吃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm eating as fast as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.80,1:19:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.20,1:19:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么知道它们来了？又看不见它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When they come, how do we know they come? We cannot see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.56,1:19:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, that is a concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.12,1:19:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,只要地面在晃动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When the ground shakes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.44,1:19:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就会知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...we know they are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.68,1:19:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dandy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.40,1:19:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,火炮枪是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is a punt gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.36,1:19:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那是猎鸭用的 可以打很多鸭子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has something to do with shooting ducks. A great many ducks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.88,1:19:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"给它上足了火药 火力十足好好冲刺"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Pour in one pound of shot or balls. Ram it down tight."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.40,1:19:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要马匹吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Won't we need the horses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.24,1:19:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,万一我们打不过的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, if we lose the fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.88,1:19:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让马出声音 否则我们的陷阱会失败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can't have them making unnecessary noise. Might spoil our trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.32,1:19:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我们不会打不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we're not going to lose, Fu-ito.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.28,1:20:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall we begin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.40,1:22:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,或许明天该再试试看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe we should try again tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.88,1:22:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,阿彭可能是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps Pyong was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.64,1:22:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,或许它们已经前往卡森城去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps they've bypassed us for Carson City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.16,1:22:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.00,1:22:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,山谷南端的山岭上都是石块 就像一道墙一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The ridge at the south end of the valley is all rock, like a big wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.40,1:22:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为它们会过得来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't think they can get past it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.36,1:22:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,它们一定还躲在某个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They gotta be somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.76,1:22:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不 福{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Fu!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.28,1:22:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快回去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.08,1:22:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我也想战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I wanna fight, too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.44,1:22:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,福{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fu, Fu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.04,1:22:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这店是我们的要塞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The store is our fort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.84,1:22:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,要塞不能没有人看守{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can't ever leave the fort unguarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.92,1:22:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你留守在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stay inside and keep guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.52,1:23:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就是现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}NOW!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.44,1:23:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你打歪了 那是大炮耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You missed! With a cannon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.92,1:23:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,上哪儿去了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where did it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.48,1:23:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,或许被炮声吓走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe the noise scared him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.80,1:23:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,又回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Gummer, it's coming! It's coming back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.44,1:23:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hiram, quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.52,1:24:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.80,1:24:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.84,1:24:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,臭毙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It stinks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.72,1:24:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那边 - 还有两只{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- There! - Two more to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.44,1:24:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快就位 退到里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take your positions! Fu Yien, back inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.04,1:25:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,胡安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.92,1:25:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,它会是故意的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did it do that on purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.88,1:25:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,当心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juan, look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.24,1:25:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.64,1:25:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法打穿泥地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cannot shoot through dirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.20,1:26:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,过来呀 可恶的怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, you son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.28,1:26:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天哪 迪科帕 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ay caramba. Tecopa, gracias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.16,1:26:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,太神奇了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Astonish...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.88,1:26:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太聪明了 我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Astonishingly clever, my man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.84,1:27:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它抢你的炮 它会知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It take your gun. Did it know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.16,1:27:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我看它们聪明绝顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear they are very intelligent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.24,1:27:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但还是不如我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But not as smart as us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.80,1:27:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是不如我们聪明 只剩下一只了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Not as smart as us. There's only one left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.32,1:27:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,它躲到哪里去了 让它自己跑出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, where the hell is it? Let it show itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.36,1:27:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,迪科帕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tecopa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.76,1:28:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,它走了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it leaving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.32,1:28:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的 它在绕圈子 听声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. No, it's circling, listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.28,1:28:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,找猎物在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For Prey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.64,1:28:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.92,1:28:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们的来福枪 没有办法把它干掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems like our rifles aren't strong enough to kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.92,1:28:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没有火炮枪 我看我们输定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without the punt gun, I feel we're lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.12,1:28:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不打了吗？要放弃吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, we just stop the fight, then? Give up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.08,1:28:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,或许该发动拖车 想办法离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe we take traction engine. Try to get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.84,1:28:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,车移动得很慢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It moves so slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.60,1:28:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你要离开这镇上吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you would leave our town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.52,1:28:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有其他办法杀掉它吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have ideas for killing it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.52,1:28:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,人可以学习面对一切难关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man must learn to sail in all winds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.12,1:28:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们手上有什么 就要用什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must do what we can with what we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.24,1:28:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,讲得真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.08,1:29:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你有火药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have black powder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.96,1:29:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要想法子引爆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe we could blow it up somehow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.56,1:29:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我们来放大炮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sure! We make big firecracker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.48,1:29:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个我懂 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I know how. - Excellent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.96,1:29:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但要静静的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But quietly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.40,1:29:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move very, very slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.04,1:29:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你去里面拿麻绳当引线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fu Yien, you go inside and get twine for fuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.48,1:29:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.00,1:29:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.60,1:29:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这种火药必须很细{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The powder for the fuse must be very fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.00,1:29:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快要好了 只要再几分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Almost there. Just another few minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.28,1:29:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,福{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fu!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.56,1:30:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,福{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fu!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.20,1:30:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不到门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't see the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.32,1:30:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你要保持安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fu, Fu, stay very quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.36,1:30:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,现在出声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make noise!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.36,1:30:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.20,1:30:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.72,1:30:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它怎么不追我们 它听到声音吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why doesn't it come for us? For the noise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.88,1:30:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 它也在学习进步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know! They keep learning our every trick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.52,1:30:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mama. He's over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.84,1:30:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就是它了 好小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go on. That's it, boy. Good boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.40,1:31:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Run, run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.16,1:31:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快 上马车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hurry up. For the wagon! To the wagon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.96,1:31:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.68,1:31:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,老天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, good Lord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.88,1:31:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,去拿来福枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's get the rifles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.04,1:31:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bomb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.80,1:31:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你要把炸弹做好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pyong, you must finish the bomb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.36,1:31:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还需要一点时闻 - 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I need more time! - Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.60,1:31:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就没有时闲完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll never have time to finish that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.52,1:31:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个点子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have an idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.24,1:32:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那大条带子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pyong, that big belt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.12,1:32:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excellent! Excellent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.60,1:32:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来帮个手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tecopa! Help us here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.80,1:32:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要找个勾子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All we need is some kind of hook!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.12,1:32:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.64,1:32:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Over here, Juan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.96,1:33:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.24,1:33:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.68,1:33:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.96,1:34:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Lord, are you well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.16,1:34:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还好 你呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.44,1:34:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, yes, lam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.68,1:34:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,迪科帕？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tecopa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.68,1:34:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ay, gracias, amiguito.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.20,1:34:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got 'em, Mr. Gummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.84,1:34:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Hiram. You got 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.24,1:34:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.44,1:34:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.80,1:34:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.84,1:34:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,银行批准你的贷款{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hiram, the bank has approved your loan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.12,1:34:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以重新雇人 重开矿坑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can hire new workers. Reopen the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.52,1:34:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我没记错 那已不是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, if I recall, it no longer belongs to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.80,1:35:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的 是你的矿坑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's yours, Hiram. It's your mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.24,1:35:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能欺骗你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We couldn't cheat you that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.48,1:35:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你比我们还要需要那矿坑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You need it worse than we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.00,1:35:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's very kind of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.16,1:35:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但我有两个条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I'll only assume ownership under two conditions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.88,1:35:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,条件？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Conditions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.00,1:35:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们绝对不告诉任何人 有关土龙的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We agree never to tell anyone about the dirt dragons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.12,1:35:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要是这种事传出去 没有人再敢来这里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If word of them ever got out, no one would ever settle here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.16,1:35:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,第二个条件呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the second condition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.40,1:35:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我的第一笔收入 将会用来建造有真正围墙的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the first proceeds of the mine are used to build a hotel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.68,1:35:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,旅馆和店铺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a market with real walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.68,1:35:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,并且帮胡安买地 还有…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To pay off Juan's land, and,uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.32,1:35:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tecopa, what do you what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.80,1:35:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,新的雕像 看起来要像我的样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A new statue. One that looks like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.08,1:35:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还要为迪科帕作个雕像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And to commission a statue for Tecopa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.56,1:35:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都同意吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is everyone agreed to this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.84,1:36:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我被你们同化了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am fearfully out-classed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.24,1:36:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你能够留下来真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's good you've decided to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.60,1:36:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我学会矿坑经营技巧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall personally supervise the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.72,1:36:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我就会自己来管理一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, as soon as I learn how it all works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.04,1:36:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我会物色一个 很棒的地方当作我的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And uh, I've selected an excellent location for my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.32,1:36:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要在高地上 完整的防护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On high ground. Readily defended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.76,1:36:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至要建造个地下室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will even have a basement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.00,1:36:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那房子一个人住太大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's an awful lot of room for one person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.20,1:36:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,理想中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ideally,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.44,1:36:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不会只有一个人住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it won't be for just one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.88,1:37:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是无药可救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I really am hopeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.44,1:37:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,多做练习你就会进步的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll get better with a little practice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.32,1:37:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,与此同时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the meantime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.44,1:37:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我买了个东西 可以帮助你瞄准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I purchased something that might aid in your success as a marksman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.84,1:37:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh. Dandy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.52,1:37:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哈兰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hiram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.64,1:37:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.96,1:37:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh-huh.{\r}
